sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Receiver
  participant APP as Mobile App
  participant API as Payment Confirmation API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  R->>APP: Approve payment
  APP->>API: PUT /api/roomspaces/:id/payments/:paymentId/confirm
  API->>DB: Update confirmation status
  API->>DB: Update settlement/balance records
  DB-->>API: Success
  API-->>APP: Confirmation approved
